I am inside my apartment.
It is cold outside, but my room is warm.
I have a small table.
I place a cup on my table.
It is a warm cup of tea.
I also have a pastry from the supermarket.
Now I find my computer.
I sit down on a chair.
I open my computer.
I look at the screen.
I miss my family in Mexico.
I press a button.
I call my mother and my father.
A tone sounds from my computer.
I wait for an answer.
My heart beats fast.
Is my family there?
I smile and look at my screen.
